---
/**
 * The sidebar's contribution prompt.
 *
 * The wording is the constitution's own position on guest authors, not marketing copy: the blog
 * takes work from anyone, and the only constraint is the subject matter.
 */
---

<section class="write-here">
    <h2 class="eyebrow">Write here</h2>
    <p>
        Guest authors have full freedom of expression, with the only condition being that the topic
        stays within software development or computer science.
    </p>
    <a class="button secondary small" href="/constitution">Read the constitution</a>
</section>

<style>
    p {
        /* Box model */
        margin-bottom: var(--space-5);

        /* Typographic */
        font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
        color: var(--text-muted);
    }
</style>
